      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Like lumbago, pains and stiffness of the shoulder are a crux medicorum. Here, however, unlike lumbago, promising treatment is possible if a correct diagnosis made. The cardial symptoms are classified for the diagnosis; conservative and surgical treatment of the individual disease pictures are described."},
